      <title>Mac Resource Monitor 1.2.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Metric collection now runs off the main thread, fixing two crash-class bugs and keeping the UI smooth under load.</li>
          <li>Unified severity thresholds and colorblind-friendly glyphs across every card.</li>
          <li>Process list gains a right-click Kill/Quit menu and a live search field.</li>
          <li>New live menu-bar readout (CPU + GPU) and a standard Settings window.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 19 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
